    <mxGraphModel dx="2052" dy="624" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam nodesep 40\nskinparam ranksep 50\nskinparam defaultTextAlignment center\nskinparam componentStyle rectangle\n\n&#39; Global Styling\nskinparam rectangle {\n    BackgroundColor White\n    BorderColor Black\n    BorderThickness 1.5\n    RoundCorner 5\n}\nskinparam arrow {\n    Color Black\n    Thickness 1\n}\n\ntitle Weather-Aware DRL Cooperative Decision System Architecture\n\n&#39; --- Initialization ---\nrectangle \&quot;Initialization &amp; Configuration\&quot; as Init {\n    json \&quot;Environmental Settings\&quot; as EnvSettings {\n        \&quot;1\&quot;: \&quot;Route/Map Topology\&quot;,\n        \&quot;2\&quot;: \&quot;Traffic Density\&quot;,\n        \&quot;3\&quot;: \&quot;Weather Profiles\&quot;,\n        \&quot;4\&quot;: \&quot;Vehicle Parameters\&quot;\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; --- Module 1 ---\nrectangle \&quot;Module 1: Simulation &amp; \\nEnvironmental Data Prep\&quot; as Mod1 {\n    rectangle \&quot;CARLA Simulator \\nEnvironment\&quot; as CarlaEnv {\n        rectangle \&quot;CarlaSim\&quot; as CS1\n    }\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;Generators &amp; \\nEnvironmental Physics\&quot; as GenPhys {\n        rectangle \&quot;(1) Heterogeneous \\nTraffic Generator\\n(IDM/Model Models)\&quot; as TrafficGen\n        rectangle \&quot;(2) Weather Physics Engine\\nDynamic Friction Calibration\\nCalculation\&quot; as PhysEngine\n        \n        TrafficGen -[hidden]- PhysEngine\n    }\n    \n    CarlaEnv -[hidden]--&gt; GenPhys\n}\n\n&#39; --- Module 2 ---\nrectangle \&quot;Module 2: Weather-Aware \\nDRL Cooperative Decision\&quot; as Mod2 {\n    rectangle \&quot;Centralized Critic Network\\n(Global Platoon State Evaluation)\&quot; as Critic {\n        rectangle \&quot;CentralCritic\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;Decentralized Actor Networks\\n(Local Control Policies)\&quot; as Actors {\n        rectangle \&quot;DecenActors\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    Critic -[hidden]- Actors\n}\n\n&#39; --- Module 3 ---\nrectangle \&quot;Module 3: Weather-Aware \\nSafety Shield\&quot; as Mod3 {\n    rectangle \&quot;Dynamic Headway\\nBoundary Planner\\n(d_safe = f(v, mu))\&quot; as Headway {\n        rectangle \&quot;HeadwayBound\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;Collision Risk Verification\\nAction Override Logic\&quot; as Risk {\n        rectangle \&quot;TwinMask\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    Headway -[hidden]- Risk\n}\n\n&#39; --- Module 4 ---\nrectangle \&quot;Module 4: Low-Level \\nKinematic Control\&quot; as Mod4 {\n    rectangle \&quot;Knowledge-Based Finite\\nContinuous Actuation\\nMode Selection\&quot; as FSM {\n        rectangle \&quot;FSM_Select\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;Bicycle Kinematic Model\\nContinuous Actuation\\nTraction\&quot; as Bicycle {\n        rectangle \&quot;BicycleModel\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    FSM -[hidden]- Bicycle\n}\n\n&#39; --- Module 5 ---\nrectangle \&quot;Module 5: Real-Time AI \\nMonitoring Dashboard\&quot; as Mod5 {\n    rectangle \&quot;FastSocket\\nAsynchronous Server\&quot; as FastSocket {\n        rectangle \&quot;FastAPIServer\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;WebSocket\\nLive Streaming Server\&quot; as WS {\n        rectangle \&quot;WS_Stream\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;React Interactive Frontend UI\&quot; as React {\n        rectangle \&quot;2D Platoon Trajectories\&quot;\n        rectangle \&quot;Spacing Threshold Graphs\&quot;\n        rectangle \&quot;Active Weather Gauges\&quot;\n        rectangle \&quot;ReactUI\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    FastSocket --&gt; WS\n    WS --&gt; React\n}\n\n&#39; --- Module 6 ---\nrectangle \&quot;Module 6: System \\nEvaluation &amp; Benchmark Analysis\&quot; as Mod6 {\n    rectangle \&quot;SIL Disturbance \\nScenarios Metrics:\\nMin TTC Calculation\\nMax DRAC Matrix\&quot; as SILMetrics {\n        rectangle \&quot;MetricsCalc\&quot;\n    }\n    \n    rectangle \&quot;Post-Simulation Evaluation &amp; \\nBenchmark Deliverables\&quot; as PostSim {\n        rectangle \&quot;ScenarioConfig\&quot; as ScenConfig\n        rectangle \&quot;Safety &amp; Efficiency\\nMetrics Calculator\&quot; as SafeCalc\n        rectangle \&quot;Baseline Comparative Metrics\\n(vs DQN, PPO, SLPLC, SIPLC)\&quot; as Baseline\n        rectangle \&quot;Outputs:\\nStatistical Evaluation Matrix\&quot; as Outputs\n        \n        ScenConfig -&gt; SafeCalc\n        SafeCalc -&gt; Baseline\n        Baseline -&gt; Outputs\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; --- Main Flows ---\n\n&#39; 1. Init to Mod 1\nInit -down-&gt; Mod1 : Initial Settings\n\n&#39; 2. Mod 1 Internal &amp; Out\nCS1 -down-&gt; GenPhys\nGenPhys -right-&gt; Mod2 : Normalized Platoon \\nState Tensor (S_t)\nGenPhys -down-&gt; Mod3 : Weather Friction Index (mu)\n\n&#39; 3. Mod 2 to Mod 3\nMod2 -right-&gt; Mod3 : Proposed Action Vector (A_pro)\nCritic -down-&gt; Actors\n\n&#39; 4. Mod 3 to Mod 4\nMod3 -right-&gt; Mod4 : Verified Safe Action Vector (A_safe)\nHeadway -down-&gt; Risk\n\n&#39; 5. Mod 4 Outputs\nFSM -down-&gt; Bicycle\nBicycle -up-&gt; Mod5 : 15 Hz Telemetry \\nFeed Stream\nBicycle -down-&gt; Mod6 : Real-Time Action \\nOverride Logs\n\n&#39; 6. Feedback Loop (The Big One)\nBicycle -left-&gt; Mod1 : Continuous Actuation Signals\\n(Throttle, Brake Pressure,\\nSteering Angle)\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="KNP_ADdgNbyXLRIP63Hc-1">
